Subject: [PATCH] Documentation: review of the READMEs and of the help of the
 options

The READMEs were checked against the programs: requirements of the prototype branch of mfem-mgis, names of the options (--postprocessing, post-processing options of the polycrystal), default numbers of steps, unknown components Fxx and Fyy. The help texts of the cermet and of the polycrystal no longer give wrong default values (MFEM prints the actual ones).
